Below is an SQS worker for Node.js 24+. It processes one job at a time and scales through container replicas. The workspace is read-only, so I’m providing the files inline.

It uses SQS long polling and deletes messages only after successful processing. Failed jobs remain available for redelivery. See [AWS’s SQS examples](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-javascript/v3/developer-guide/javascript_sqs_code_examples.html).

Install the dependency and commit both package files:

```sh
npm init -y
npm install --save-exact @aws-sdk/client-sqs
```

