- Make the job endpoint enforce durable idempotency. A crash after committing an effect but before deleting the message can cause duplicate delivery.
- Scale replicas using queue backlog and oldest-message age. Collect JSON stdout logs and alert on repeated polling failures and DLQ growth.
- Pin the container image by digest in your release pipeline.

This implementation assumes bounded, asynchronous jobs; longer jobs need visibility renewal. It has not been integration-tested against your queue or job endpoint.

